  "description": "Looking for a reliable VoltBike that fits your budget without sacrificing the essentials? Meet the VoltBike Mariner Lite—a smart, affordable take on one of our most popular folding models.\nBuilt on the same comfortable and easy-to-mount step-through frame that riders already love, the Mariner Lite keeps what matters most while trimming costs where it counts. You still get a powerful, long-range ride thanks to the large 20Ah (960Wh) lithium-ion battery—perfect for long rides.\nTo make this model more accessible, we’ve equipped it with budget-friendly yet dependable components, including a Shimano Tourney rear derailleur, CST Adventure tires, a Sutto motor, lightweight plastic fenders and more. These thoughtful adjustments help lower the price while maintaining solid performance and everyday usability.\nThe result? A practical, foldable e-bike that delivers great value, impressive range, and the core Mariner experience—now at a price that’s easier to ride with.",
